            "kind": "native-bracket",
            "text": "alpha/opus[1m]",
            "message": "a context size is written [ctx=1m], not a tool's own [1m]: \"alpha/opus[1m]\""
          },
          "message": "order[1]: a context size is written [ctx=1m], not a tool's own [1m]: \"alpha/opus[1m]\""
        },
        "message": "binding profile: order[1]: a context size is written [ctx=1m], not a tool's own [1m]: \"alpha/opus[1m]\""
